{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into hell and spray it down in this couch coop twin stick shooter. Team up with 1 to 3 friends and save victims, houses and trees from the flames and those who ignite them. Enhance your firepower waterpower with special upgrades designed to beat the heat from the unique fires you'll encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As super firefighters, your mission is to protect the forest by hosing down the flames with your super water gun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear missions as a 1 to 4 members crew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the first 4 levels  in the 1st region</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire everywhere! Try to not spread the problem...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your super water canon and tune it with up to 10 of the 20+ unlockable upgrades available in the full game to master every situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011690?t=1757529292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011690?t=1757529292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011690/eb529575b98877c3c0c8ad668d952b4b4bfd0b52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757529292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011690/eb529575b98877c3c0c8ad668d952b4b4bfd0b52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757529292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Scre